                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>The paving expenses studied are those made by Ghent's city government during the 14th century (1321-1389). In this GIS layer, it is the number of mention of paving work per locations which is recorded. NB: this GIS layer contains only linear locations.</p>"
